# X-Y system

@left

![X-Y system](assets/lect06d-x_linked_genes_1/xy_inheritance.svg)

@right

- The sperm contributes an X or Y chromosome.
- Males are [*heterogametic*]{color=blue underline=true} (XY).
- Females are [*homogametic*]{color=red underline=true} (XX).

@notes

