# Z-W system

@left

![Z-W system](assets/lect06d-x_linked_genes_1/zw_system.svg)

@right

- In birds, some fishes, and some insects, the egg determines offspring sex.
- Females are [*heterogametic*]{underline=true} (ZW).
- Males are [*homogametic*]{underline=true} (ZZ).

@notes

